  "text": "### 7. Audit Committee Oversight  \n**Board Audit Committee Responsibilities:**\n- Approve annual audit plan\n- Receive quarterly audit updates\n- Review significant findings\n- Monitor management remediation\n- Approve audit budget\n- Assess Internal Audit effectiveness\n- Meet separately with Internal Audit (no management present)  \n**Meeting Frequency:**\n- Quarterly (minimum)\n- Emergency meetings as needed\n- Executive session with Head of Internal Audit (quarterly)  \n---",
